# role-devops — a thin COMPOSITE bundle for ops/platform work (FETCHED-ONLINE,
# never baked). Composes primitives' members directly (no `#meta:requires` in the
# engine; pacman --needed dedupes). KEEP THIS SMALL.
#
# Source packs it mirrors:
#   • containers → lazydocker, ctop, dive, k9s, kubectl, helm  (orchestration CLIs;
#                  `kind` is AUR — left to the containers pack so this bundle is
#                  all official-repo and never blocks on an AUR build)
#   • dev-cli    → dust, procs, bottom, hyperfine               (system + perf CLIs)
# The container ENGINES (docker/podman/compose) are already baked; this bundle is
# the orchestration + observability tooling on top. Rootless podman is a
# `containers --rootless` choice, not a role concern — a role composes package
# members only, not another pack's side-effect hooks.
#meta:type role
lazydocker
ctop
dive
k9s
kubectl
helm
dust
procs
bottom
hyperfine
